 "source_notes": {
  "wdi_gdp": "Re-based to REAL growth (2026-06): 2015 base level (current USD, NY.GDP.MKTP.CD) carried forward by the real PPP growth index from World Bank NY.GDP.MKTP.PP.KD (constant 2021 intl $). The model is a real-output growth model, so it is validated against real (not nominal) GDP growth; the prior nominal series conflated ~1.8%/yr deflator with real activity and required a compensating decarbonisation fudge.",
  "wdi_population": "World Bank WDI API, indicator SP.POP.TOTL, used for 2015 initial-state alignment.",
  "wdi_fx_reserves": "World Bank WDI API, indicator FI.RES.XGLD.CD, used for 2015 initial-state alignment.",
  "wdi_public_debt": "World Bank WDI API, indicator GC.DOD.TOTL.GD.ZS, used for 2015 initial-state alignment.",
  "wdi_country_co2": "World Bank WDI API, indicator EN.GHG.CO2.MT.CE.AR5, used for 2015 initial-state alignment.",
  "gcp_global_co2": "Global Carbon Budget 2024 workbook, sheet 'Global Carbon Budget', column 'fossil emissions excluding carbonation', converted from GtC/yr to GtCO2/yr.",
  "hadcrut5_temperature": "HadCRUT.5.1.0.0 annual global summary series from the Met Office, rebased to an 1850-1900 mean so the anomaly matches the model's preindustrial framing.",
  "noaa_atmospheric_co2": "NOAA GML global annual mean atmospheric CO2 concentration, used to seed the 2015 atmospheric stock before the simulation starts.",
  "resource_price_index": "World Bank Commodity Markets Outlook (Pink Sheet), annual nominal indices, 2010=100, sheet 'Annual Indices (Nominal)', retrieved 2026-08-24, CC BY 4.0. Series: Energy, Food, Metals & Minerals. Renormalised to 2015 = 1.0 to match the model's price index convention. Source file mirrored at data/external/worldbank_commodity_price_indices_annual.csv. NOTE: these are MARKET price indices for traded baskets; the model's prices are CLEARING indices for three aggregate resources with a reserve buffer and no storage or financialisation, so they are scored on direction and multi-year magnitude, not year-by-year timing."
 },
